# Artificial Evolution changes Tower’s Wall word to Elf before activation, so Elves cannot block the target and Walls can (CR 612.2, 509.1b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Tower of Coireall
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Memnite
Phyrexian Walker
Artificial Evolution
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Wall of Wood
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Emerald
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tower of Coireall.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Wood.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Tower of Coireall)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Wall)
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Tower of Coireall.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Battlefield.Tower of Coireall.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tower of Coireall.Tapped = true
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Tower of Coireall.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Memnite)
Bot2.Block(Wall of Wood > Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 20
